<title>FRANCE: Lagardere suspended until bid at 161.3 Fr.</title>
<headline>Lagardere suspended until bid at 161.3 Fr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French conglomerate Lagardere Groupe were suspended limit up at their third attempt to requote on Thursday, the SBF French stock markets association said.</p>
<p>The shares will requote when bids fall within the trading limit set at 161.30 francs per share, an SBF spokesman said.</p>
</text>
